Meta.documentation:exec
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Runs a shell command and hands stdout downstream as String on completion.
Meta.documentation:Non-zero exit or spawn failure goes to out_error. Intended for localhost
Meta.documentation:IDE plumbing only - never a remote surface.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default - collected stdout
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all - the command line to run
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_default_$all - command as bytes
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20StringRes%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FString%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20exec%3A%20runs%20a%20shell%20command%20and%20hands%20stdout%20downstream%20as%20String%20on%0A%2F%2F%20completion.%20Non-zero%20exit%20or%20a%20spawn%20error%20goes%20to%20out_error.%0A%2F%2F%20localhost-scoped%20use%20only%20(IDE%20save%20hooks%20etc.).%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Flows%20propagate%20through%20ports%3A%20only%20the%20chain%20head's%20in_go%20fires%2C%20so%20the%0A%2F%2F%20command%20runs%20when%20it%20ARRIVES%20on%20in_String_default%20%2F%20in_octetstream_default.%0Afunction%20exec()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22exec%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20execProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20execProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_String_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09let%20command%20%3D%20%22%22%3B%0A%09let%20done%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09newObject.command%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(input.value%20%7C%7C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09if%20(resource.command)%20command%20%3D%20resource.command%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_String_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20command%20%3D%20input.value%3B%20this.run()%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_octetstream_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09command%20%3D%20new%20TextDecoder().decode(input.value%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20new%20Uint8Array(input.value))%3B%0A%09%09this.run()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20function()%20%7B%20this.run()%3B%20%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20URI-supplied%20command%20at%20boot%0A%0A%09this.run%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(done%20%7C%7C%20!command)%20return%3B%0A%09%09done%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09require(%22child_process%22).exec(command%2C%20%7B%20windowsHide%3A%20true%20%7D%2C%20function(err%2C%20stdout%2C%20stderr)%20%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(err)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09self.out_error%3F.(%7B%20value%3A%20(stderr%20%7C%7C%20err.message%20%7C%7C%20%22exec%20failed%22).toString()%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09let%20s%20%3D%20new%20StringRes()%3B%0A%09%09%09s.value%20%3D%20String(stdout)%3B%0A%09%09%09self.out_String_default%3F.(s)%3B%0A%09%09%7D)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0Aexec.Processor%20%3D%20execProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20exec%3B]>>NewResource:exec
